Attribution
-----------
The library's README asks every page that uses it to show the attribution notice above and a
link to https://www.tradingview.com/. It names the chart's attributionLogo option as one way
to show the link, not a requirement.

Desk Brief turns the logo off (attributionLogo: false in tvchart.js), because the logo's
link carries a title attribute and P-022 allows none. Instead, under every chart,
app/components/tvchart.py (attribution) draws a visible, keyboard-focusable text link
"Charts by TradingView" to https://www.tradingview.com/ followed by the attribution notice
("TradingView Lightweight Charts™ © 2025 TradingView, Inc."), in the theme's meta colour.

Upgrading: Dependabot does not track this file. Follow the steps in the docstring of
app/components/tvchart.py and update this NOTICE, SHA256SUMS and LIBRARY_VERSION together.
